WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.880
And that's 15 seconds, that's three quarters of the way done.

2
00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:08.560
We are almost finished, keep those knees going.

3
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.000
Remember keep driving them up, you want those knees at least hip height, try to keep driving

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.000
them up.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
We've got about five seconds left.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
We're switching to burpees next, remember no rest.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.680
And switch it right into those burpees.

8
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:24.840
Out to full push-up position, then come back up to those feet and do a nice quick jump,

9
00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.200
then drop right back down into that push-up position.

10
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.000
Just keep it going really nice and quick.

11
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.800
You want to move those feet out as quickly as you can, both at the same time.

12
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.800
Try not to bring one in at a time.

13
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.400
You want a constant, complete motion with your entire body.

14
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.440
And that's halfway done right there, just keep that motion going.

15
00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:56.000
Nice clean motion, remember get those feet all the way out to that full push-up position.
